# Voice samples for X5 / ticket H4: real paid provider output, never committed
# (issue 43-h4-voice-providers). The folder itself stays, so the sample job has
# somewhere to write on a fresh clone.
live-checks/voice-samples/*
!live-checks/voice-samples/.gitkeep

# Live-check reports (issue 42-h3-live-check-tools). Every run writes one real
# measurement here. They are Boss's numbers, not source: he copies them into
# notes.md himself, and a report can quote a question from a paper.
live-checks/results/*
!live-checks/results/.gitkeep

# Boss's go-live signature sheet (issue 44-h5-golive-readiness). Real names and
# dates about one real business, not source. The committed template is
# golive.example.json.
golive.json
